  "final_message": "App is complete and verified end-to-end.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask + stdlib sqlite3/pbkdf2/secrets (no new deps, lock unchanged). SQLite at `./data/books.db` (WAL), token sessions via `Authorization: Bearer`, all specified endpoints with validation errors (`{\"error\": msg}`), paging/search (`q` on title/author), PUT clearing omitted `year`/`isbn`, one-review-per-user (409), cascading delete, rounded `average_rating`, SPA fallback for non-`/api` paths.\n\n**Frontend** (Vite + React/TS, Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`, only `src/index.css` is `@import \"tailwindcss\"`): hash-routed pages \u2014 book list with debounced search/paging/confirm-delete, book detail with reviews + rating form, add/edit forms surfacing API validation messages, register/sign-in with header username + sign-out (token in localStorage).\n\n**Verified**: full HTTP test suite against gunicorn on :8000 (all edge cases pass), data survives restart, `tsc --noEmit` clean, `npm ci && npm run build` from lockfile succeeds.",
